                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>USAGE INSTRUCTIONS :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>1. Use the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>&apos;Cases&apos;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'> selector to chose what kind of cases would you like to view this metric by i.e </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Incoming cases</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'> or </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Resolved cases</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>2. Use the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>&apos;Cases per Order by Delivery Type&apos; </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>filter to choose what kind of orders would you like to view this metric by i.e </run>
