        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Shape' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <lod column='[federated.15cehv015dgmno1abds701w52j7r].[sum:KPIs Graphs (copy)_552535426223271940:qk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Ownership</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'> can be one of the following values :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>1. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Rider</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos;    : the contact reason was due to Rider issue</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>2. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Vendor</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos;   : the contact reason was due to Vendor issue</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>3. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Service</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos;  : the contact reason was due to Service issue</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>4. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Platform</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos; : the contact reason was due to Platform issue</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>5. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Customer</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos; : the contact reason was due to Customer issue</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>6. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Pending</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos;  : the contact reason cannot be determined at the moment due to lack of data points</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>7. &apos;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Unknown</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>&apos;  : this can be due to the following reasons :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>                1. Contact reason code attached to the contact does not follow global standards (aka 2D, 1C etc.)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>                2. No order ID is attached to the contact (aka order ID is NULL)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>                3. Order ID is ok, Contact reason code is ok, but we could verify ownership for only some of the Contact reason owners. The remaining owners cannot be determined at the moment due to lack of data points</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>                4. Order ID is ok, Contact reason code is ok and ownership has been verified for all the possible contact reason owners. So we do not know why this contact happened</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>                5. Order ID is ok, Contact reason code is ok but owners cannot be determined at the moment due to technical limitations with the Rider / Vendor data</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='JetBrains Mono,monospace' fontsize='9' italic='true'>NOTE : Please refer to this confluence page for examples : https://confluence.deliveryhero.com/display/LOG/A+note+on+Contact+Reasons</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='shape' value='Bug Tracking/light.png' />
                <format attr='size' value='2.022099494934082' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
